      {
        "id": "tb-point-mass",
        "moduleId": "m1-point-mass-newton",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "质点与牛顿第二定律",
        "markdown": "牛顿力学最基本的形式只描述质点：质量为 $m$、尺寸无限小、全部质量集中于位置矢量 $\\mathbf r$ 所确定的那一点。质点没有姿态，因为无法为它定义任何几何形状；因此只需牛顿第二定律就足以描述它的运动。若把质量看作无穷小量 $\\mathrm dm$，则可把它所受的力记作作用在该点上的无穷小力 $\\mathrm d\\mathbf F$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000017"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 3 Dynamics",
                "Foundations from Classical Mechanics"
              ],
              "lineStart": 412,
              "lineEnd": 430,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a224f661b3cecdc276834504e56601f9605873a15f5db9e58866643fe381fc43"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-newton-reading",
        "moduleId": "m1-point-mass-newton",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：牛顿第二定律的读法",
        "markdown": "对这样一个质点，牛顿第二定律给出 $\\mathbf F = m\\ddot{\\mathbf r}$：合外力决定加速度，而质量是惯性大小的度量。后续讨论刚体时，线性运动部分仍可归结为质心处的同一条关系，这正是教材所说的 (3.2) 仍适用于质心线性动力学的原因。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-point-mass"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-point-mass-check",
        "moduleId": "m1-point-mass-newton",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "常见误解：质点也有转动",
        "markdown": "质点没有自转，因此不存在独立的转动方程；但它在空间中运动时仍可对某个参考点产生轨道角动量。当质量分散在有限体积内时，必须另外描述转动惯量与角速度，这正是刚体动力学要补上的部分。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-point-mass",
            "model-newton-reading"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-virtual-displacement",
        "moduleId": "m2-virtual-displacement",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "变分与虚位移",
        "markdown": "变分记号 $\\delta$ 与微分 $\\mathrm d$ 形式相似，含义却不同：微分描述随时间发生的无穷小改变，用于定义变化率；变分则在固定时刻考察量在满足约束前提下所有可能的移动方向。对时间相关的量取变分时，时间依赖被完全忽略。设位置是广义坐标与时间的函数 $\\mathbf r=\\mathbf r(\\mathbf q,t)$，对 $n_q$ 个广义坐标应用链式法则得到其允许变分，即虚位移 $\\delta\\mathbf r$；该表达式中不含 $\\partial\\mathbf r/\\partial t$ 项，因此虚位移是对位移的纯几何描述。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000017"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 3 Dynamics",
                "Foundations from Classical Mechanics"
              ],
              "lineStart": 412,
              "lineEnd": 430,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a224f661b3cecdc276834504e56601f9605873a15f5db9e58866643fe381fc43"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-variation-vs-differential",
        "moduleId": "m2-virtual-displacement",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "comparison",
        "title": "补充：微分与变分的对照",
        "markdown": "微分 $\\mathrm d\\mathbf r$ 记录真实时间演化，包含 $\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf r}{\\partial t}\\,\\mathrm dt$ 一项；虚位移 $\\delta\\mathbf r$ 冻结时间，只保留广义坐标方向的可行变化：$$\\delta\\mathbf r = \\sum_{i=1}^{n_q}\\frac{\\partial \\mathbf r}{\\partial q_i}\\,\\delta q_i .$$ 因此变分回答的是“此刻允许往哪里动”，而不是“下一刻实际会到哪里”。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-virtual-displacement"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-rigid-body",
        "moduleId": "m3-rigid-body",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "刚体由质点集合构成",
        "markdown": "刚体可以看作大量紧密排列的质点：每个无穷小质量 $\\mathrm dm$ 都随整体运动，因此在任意时刻都有绝对位置和速度。取刚体上另一点 $S$，用 $\\boldsymbol\\rho$ 表示 $\\mathrm dm$ 相对 $S$ 的位置，就可以借助刚体运动学，通过 $S$ 的绝对运动加上相对转动来描述 $\\mathrm dm$ 的运动。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000017"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 3 Dynamics",
                "Foundations from Classical Mechanics"
              ],
              "lineStart": 412,
              "lineEnd": 430,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "a224f661b3cecdc276834504e56601f9605873a15f5db9e58866643fe381fc43"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-rigid-body-velocity",
        "moduleId": "m3-rigid-body",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "补充：刚体上一点的速度与虚位移",
        "markdown": "把上述分解写成速度和虚位移：$$\\mathbf v = \\mathbf v_S + \\boldsymbol\\Omega\\times\\boldsymbol\\rho,\\qquad \\delta\\mathbf r = \\delta\\mathbf r_{OS} + \\delta\\boldsymbol\\Phi\\times\\boldsymbol\\rho .$$ 其中 $\\mathbf v_S$ 是 $S$ 的绝对速度，$\\boldsymbol\\Omega$ 是刚体角速度，$\\delta\\boldsymbol\\Phi$ 表示局部坐标系姿态的约束相容变分。由于姿态不是可直接求导的向量，$\\delta\\boldsymbol\\Phi$ 与角速度一样不能写成某个姿态量的时间导数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-virtual-displacement",
            "tb-rigid-body"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-multibody-constraints",
        "moduleId": "m4-multibody-virtual-work",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "多体系统与关节约束",
        "markdown": "多体系统只能完成与关节约束相容的运动，关节限制了相邻连杆之间的相对运动；这种运动通常用广义坐标 $\\mathbf q$ 描述。把变分应用到系统的位置关系上可知，与关节一致的虚位移必须具有相应形式：只有落在约束允许方向上的变化，才是可行的虚位移。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-95ba03a6a2c7e96e42594033",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000017"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "Chapter 3 Dynamics",
